OVERVIEW: DICOM compression and decompression utilities

Compress, decompress, and analyze DICOM file transfer syntaxes.

Examples:
  dicom-compress info file.dcm
  dicom-compress info file.dcm --json
  dicom-compress compress input.dcm --output output.dcm --codec jpeg-lossless
  dicom-compress compress input.dcm --output output.dcm --codec jpeg2000
--quality high
  dicom-compress decompress compressed.dcm --output uncompressed.dcm
  dicom-compress decompress compressed.dcm --output uncompressed.dcm --syntax
explicit-le
  dicom-compress batch input_dir/ --output output_dir/ --codec jpeg-lossless
--recursive
  dicom-compress batch input_dir/ --output output_dir/ --decompress --recursive

USAGE: dicom-compress <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  compress                Compress a DICOM file using a specified codec
  decompress              Decompress a compressed DICOM file
  info (default)          Show compression information about a DICOM file
  batch                   Batch compress or decompress DICOM files in a
                          directory
  backends                List available hardware acceleration backends

  See 'dicom-compress help <subcommand>' for detailed help.
